(text "ST33KTPM2X TPM on SPI from the loader domain (DB5174 rev 3, figure 3).\nRST driven by the FPGA with a 10k pull-down; 10k pull-up on PIRQ (mandatory).\n33R series on CLK/MOSI/MISO and 56p on CS: optional, fit as the layout requires.\nGPIO_PP, GPI_I2C_Select, I2C and NiC pins open (SPI mode). VPS slew 2 V/ms min (table 4)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 285 196 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "58c1e28d-51cc-5cf9-bf4e-df69d0a2e5db")))
